  "problem": "The table below gives the medication infusion rate $r(t)$, in milligrams per minute, for a patient.\n\n| $t\\,\\text{(minutes)}$ | $0$ | $4$ | $7$ | $10$ | $13$ | $18$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $r(t)\\,\\text{(mg/min)}$ | $6$ | $5$ | $3$ | $4$ | $2$ | $1$ |\n\nUse the right Riemann sum over $[0,18]$ with five subintervals to approximate the total medication delivered (in milligrams).\n\nThe total medication delivered is\n{{field-1}} milligrams.",
